<title>FINLAND: HONKARAKENNE SWINGS TO JAN-APRIL PROFIT.</title>
<headline>HONKARAKENNE SWINGS TO JAN-APRIL PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     1.3 vs 6.9 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.01 vs 1.81 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  103.0 vs 77.6</p>
